
# For local development: this lesson uses the Claude Agent SDK, which
# reuses your Claude Code CLI login ("claude login") -- covered by a
# Pro/Max subscription, so ANTHROPIC_API_KEY can stay unset. Only set
# these if you want to bill against a specific key/API credits instead:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=your-base-url-here
#
# Exception: `npm run start:thinking` (src/thinking-with-tools.ts) calls
# the raw Messages API directly, not the Agent SDK, so it always needs a
# real ANTHROPIC_API_KEY with API credits, regardless of Claude Code login.

# Required for all environments — copy .env.example to .env:
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929
